      "name": "Action Safe to Send?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CSR-03 | Execute Support Responses\n\nPurpose\nSend saved support responses that meet approval\nand ticket-readiness checks.\n\nFlow\nRead unexecuted actions → check eligibility\n→ verify ticket readiness → send email\n→ record the Gmail message ID → update ticket status.\n\nEligible actions\nApproved, or Not Required with requires_approval false.\nDraft must be non-empty, execution Not Started,\nand Gmail message ID empty.\n\nDemo setup\nEmails currently go to a fixed test inbox.\nRun this workflow manually, one execution at a time.\n\n**Author: Maha**\nAI automation and product focused roles",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -544,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "d397b0b4-c8c3-4358-ba8d-9105d862abf5",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Action Eligibility Checks\n\nRead actions with execution_status Not Started\nand process them one at a time.\n\nContinue only when:\n• Approval is Approved, or approval is Not Required\n  and requires_approval is false.\n• The saved response draft is non-empty.\n• Execution status is Not Started.\n• Gmail message ID is empty.\n\nActions that fail these checks are skipped.\n\nThese checks reduce repeat sends during sequential runs.\nThey do not prevent concurrent executions from racing.",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 528
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -368
      ],
      "id": "5b05f31e-9fcb-47b2-ac36-4ee65e8e56ed",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Ticket Readiness & Response Preparation\n\nRetrieve the support ticket for the eligible action.\n\nContinue only when the ticket is READY_TO_EXECUTE\nand its ticket ID and order ID match the action.\n\nUse the saved draft and proposed action from Action_Log.\nDo not regenerate the response before sending.\n\nMark the action In Progress before the email step.\n\nIf execution stops after this update, review the action\nand Gmail Sent before attempting recovery.",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 448
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1056,
        112
      ],
      "id": "0f659809-52a7-4a27-b489-d59afc8abdab",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Send Response & Record Results\n\nSend the saved response through Gmail.\nThe demo uses a fixed test inbox.\n\nAfter Gmail returns success:\n• Mark the action Executed.\n• Record executed_at and the Gmail message ID.\n• Mark the ticket RESPONSE_SENT.\n\nResolution status:\nPhoto or return-condition requests → Awaiting Customer.\nOther proposed actions → Needs Follow-up.\n\nSending a response does not execute a refund,\nreplacement, return, or delivery investigation.",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 448
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1696,
        96
      ],
      "id": "91c85830-9fc9-49f8-a83d-732f737b1641",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Email Error & Manual Recovery\n\nIf Gmail returns an error:\n• Mark the action execution status Needs Review.\n• Record the error in Action_Log.\n• Mark the ticket SEND_REVIEW_REQUIRED\n  with resolution status Needs Review.\n\nCheck Gmail Sent and Action_Log before retrying.\nAn error does not always confirm that no email was sent.\n\nThis branch requires manual review.\nIt does not automatically retry the email.",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2224,
        -432
      ],
      "id": "668161eb-d8c9-4598-be91-2860fe76b9e2",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    }
  ],
